::ingredients

(tomato sauce) 1 part
(mayonnaise) 2 parts

::instructions

{sauce} = (tomato sauce) + (mayonnaise)
    <mix>
# Enjoy!

::notes

What 'part' means is up to you, because that will determine how much sauce you will have. You can also adjust this to your liking. More tomato sauce, more acidity. More mayonnaise, more sweetness.

::story

This is a simple and well known recipe. It goes by many names and this recipe is a starting point for many sauces, eg '1000 island sauce'.


